{
    "title": "Gold Classic 1 Wear OS 4+",
    "description": "This Watch face  for wear OS 4+ has the following features:-\r\n\r\n0. The hands option in customization menu allows switching off secs needle.\r\n1. Tap on OQ logo to open Watch Battery settings.\r\n2. Tap on Date Text to open Calendar app.\r\n3. 1-Tap change backgrounds for main display is also available.\r\n4. Backgrounds styles each for AoD and Main display are available separately in customization menu.\r\n5. Dim Mode is available via customization menu for both AoD and Main separately.\r\n6. 6 x customization complication shortcuts are available in customization menu.\r\n7. 1 x customizable complication which can be also switched off and used for weather,steps,feels like, etc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This Watch face  for wear OS 4+ has the following features:-<br><br>0. The hands option in customization menu allows switching off secs needle.<br>1. Tap on OQ logo to open Watch Battery settings.<br>2. Tap on Date Text to open Calendar app.<br>3. 1-Tap change backgrounds for main display is also available.<br>4. Backgrounds styles each for AoD and Main display are available separately in customization menu.<br>5. Dim Mode is available via customization menu for both AoD and Main separately.<br>6. 6 x customization complication shortcuts are available in customization menu.<br>7. 1 x customizable complication which can be also switched off and used for weather,steps,feels like, etc.",
